26004:{s:"Organon",e:"Hippocrates-Similia (IV), Lord Bacon-Inductive logic (III), Horace-Aude Sapere (II), Paracelsus-Doctrine of Signature (I). Answer: A-IV, B-III, C-II, D-I."},
26005:{s:"Organon",e:"Idiosyncrasy (§117) is the peculiar individual susceptibility where certain persons react unusually to substances that don't affect most people."},
