26017:{s:"Organon",e:"Tolle Causam means 'remove the cause' — a principle of treatment addressing the root cause of disease."},
26018:{s:"Organon",e:"New symptoms NOT belonging to the disease after a remedy indicate the medicine was NOT the perfect simillimum — a new remedy matching all symptoms is needed (§162)."},
